(text "DFFP2_J2N16: two pulse-clocked D flip-flops, Qi takes Di at the RISING edge of Ci. 7 tubes: 2 x DFFP_J2N16 + one 6N16B.\nThe 6N16B inverts D1 and D2 (Ra 10k, grid through 470k || 3.9 pF / 200k); its plates DN1, DN2 go to the slow R dividers.\nD1, D2: HV pins (the cell has its own dividers; ~1.2 mA DC each, at most two such pins per net). C1, C2: HV clock lines\n(3.9 pF each, edges up to 300 ns). Q, QN: HV, max fanout 6. Liberty: DFFP_J2N16 = one flip-flop, 3.5 tubes.\nPage: sch/logic/DFFP2_J2N16/README.md; study: doc/tc_n5_pulse_dff.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8de43881-d16c-4566-8d8a-35b36e46042c"))

(embedded_fonts no))
